[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8235.589, "timestamp": "02:17:15", "text": "ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8245.509, "timestamp": "02:17:25", "text": "、ピングが異常だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8247.83, "timestamp": "02:17:27", "text": "私はここから出て行く。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8257.83, "timestamp": "02:17:37", "text": "ラインケーブルを買ってみるべきだと思います。   なんてこった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8260.309, "timestamp": "02:17:40", "text": "ええ、待ってください。 それをお持ちでないのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8262.629, "timestamp": "02:17:42", "text": "いや、いや、いや。 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8264.79, "timestamp": "02:17:44", "text": "アパートにあるルーターを使っているだけです。   とんでも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8265.75, "timestamp": "02:17:45", "text": "ない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8269.349, "timestamp": "02:17:49", "text": "しかも無料Wi-Fiだから、それは良い点だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8271.83, "timestamp": "02:17:51", "text": "ああ、それはいいですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8273.03, "timestamp": "02:17:53", "text": "それだけは私が支払う必要のないものです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8273.349, "timestamp": "02:17:53", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8274.389, "timestamp": "02:17:54", "text": "はい。   他のものは全て代償を払わなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8277.99, "timestamp": "02:17:57", "text": "。   惜しかったね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8278.87, "timestamp": "02:17:58", "text": "。"}]